Package: com.omaralasam.autoicons
Name: Omar Auto Icons
Version: 0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Standalone day/night icon switcher for SpringBoard. No SnowBoard required. First install needs one respring, then automatic switching refreshes icons without respring.
Maintainer: Omar Alasam
Author: Omar Alasam
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
